.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt PLANMODE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm planmode
.Nd install, verify, and manage the canonical OpenCode Plan workflow
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
creates and verifies the symlinks, commands, skills, and global configuration
required for the canonical OpenCode Plan-mode workflow.
It is POSIX sh orchestration over Lua 5.4 bytecode.
It does not mutate the repository except during
.Cm install
with explicit consent, and it does not force-push or rewrite history.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Cm install
Install links and the managed config key (short option: \\-i)
.Pp
.Cm repair
Re-create safe symlinks and config key (short option: \\-q)
.Pp
.Cm verify
Verify the installed files and OpenCode discovery (short option: \\-v)
.Pp
.Cm upgrade-check
Require the tested OpenCode baseline (short option: \\-x)
.Pp
.Cm status
Print a read-only health report (short option: \\-s)
.Pp
.Cm backup
Create a timestamped config backup (short option: \\-b)
.Pp
.Cm restore Ar file
Restore the global config from a backup (short option: \\-r)
.Pp
.Cm reload
Run opencode reload or print a restart instruction (short option: \\-l)
.Pp
.Cm uninstall
Remove managed links and the managed config key (short option: \\-u)
.Pp
.Cm help
Show usage (short option: \\-h)
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Op EV OPENCODE_CONFIG Path to the OpenCode config file. Defaults to $HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json .
.Pp
.Op EV OPENCODE_TESTED_VERSION OpenCode version the workflow was last verified against. Defaults to 2.2.6 .
.Pp
.Op EV OPENCODE_BIN Path to the opencode binary .
.Sh FILES
.Pa ~/.local/bin/planmode symlink to this script for PATH invocation .
.Pp
.Pa ~/.local/bin/pm shortcut symlink to this script .
.Pa ~/.profile .Pa ~/.ashrc prepend .Pa ~/.local/bin to PATH for login and interactive shells .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
See the manuals for make, mandoc, cvs, git, gpg, sh and lua5.4.
